# kits.pdl - role kits (design section 2). Given at Setup / Add participant as append-only GRANT rows in grants.txt; Reset / Remove take back exactly these.
# KITITEM | kit | item | amount      KITSKILL | kit | skill | 1      KITPARAM | kit | stat | delta  (stat is a key of actor_1_stats.txt; additive so it is reversible)
KITITEM  | farmer | seed | 5
KITITEM  | farmer | jug  | 1
KITITEM  | farmer | hoe  | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | plant   | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | water   | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | collect | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | trade   | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | talk    | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | eat     | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | rest    | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | study   | 1
KITSKILL | farmer | build   | 1
KITPARAM | farmer | mhp | 10
KITPARAM | farmer | hp  | 10
# --- v1 PLAYKIT (game.pdl `PLAYKIT | kit=settler`): applied by Start game on top of the farmer kit, as ordinary GRANT rows (Stop revokes them, Reset takes them back).
